      "title": "transcription-verbatim",
      "description": "Check L1 authored from pictures (a schedule poster, a slide deck: a source with no usable text layer) against the image narratives and transcriptions it names: every statement verbatim in one of them, every transcription word corroborated by the entry's text layer unless listed under inspectionOnly, and unique keys. A step of recommendation-extraction, in place of recommendation-candidates when that step found no normative sentence; the `l1-transcription-verbatim` Tool satisfies it.",
